  "description": "Offline software licensing for .NET: a compact signed licence token (JWS-style, ECDSA/RSA), a key ring scoped per product line, tolerant n-of-m machine binding, validation that reports a reason rather than a boolean, and a store that survives clock tampering. No BouncyCastle, no vendor service, no phone-home.",
